ation, price rules, save format and player copy are retained.\n\n### Evidence\n\n- Root baseline on current integrated source: 6 failures / 1 ordinary control, showing pending80 versus actual1425, partial0/40 versus355, occupied65 versus0/315.\n- Ten real projection-to-exact-revision-command cases, current/legacy encoded Save/Load and immutable complete snapshots.\n- Agent production mutations: disconnect reader9red/1control; final-group demand1red/9controls; live preview relocation2red/8controls. Exact restoration green.\n- Root integration:224tests across13 selected accounting, template, zoning, ordinary-refund and documentation files green,53.33s; app/toolsTypeScript and hydrated production build green.\n- Only newly shifted live anchors corrected; historical coordinates and unchanged guard budgets retained.\n\nExact-head CI and serial main green are required before merge. This is draft and no hosted deployment/native browser acceptance is claimed for this batch.\n\nEvidence: docs/research/2026-10-02-template-cancel-refund-preview.md.\n## Integrated delivery checkpoint — 2026-10-02\n\nLatest published candidate: `41998ff60f`. Base remains PR #1899 at `3eeeddc2d276714fee6a7c8420270b78d2e49b3c`; the earlier candidate stays frozen. The initial refund-only evidence above is retained as dated history.\n\nAdditional integrated changes:\n\n- Dedicated authored Kitchen stove: retain 29 assemblies/six materials and add 51 physical details; 72 repeatable grounded 2x1 shared-camera renders, five native geometry/camera negatives, PNG restoration, normal/rotated actual Kitchen construction and Save/Load. Eight consumer pixel negatives and exact restored native acceptance. Original source preserved.\n- Manual completed-template door removal uses collective preparation before mutation, preserving ordinary walls and single standing-object removal. Current/legacy occupied refusal, spare-cell relocation and Undo/Redo covered; production mutation12red/5controls.\n- Paused saved-template pending-object removal prepares the whole gesture in both object-entry commands and reconciles immediately. Root baseline4red/2controls; two producer mutations8red each, exact restored16cases and agent397 related checks green. Existing manual-door preparation retained.\n- Existing View selector now accepts a native mouse press rather than leaking it to an armed map. One CSS opt-in; source-only mutation4red, restored4green. Acceptance includes mouse acquisition followed by native keyboard choice, actual renderer pixels and zero unintended commands; full popup-row mouse selection remains unproved.\n- Native Bed/Yard drag coverage extends the existing capture fix without changing production. Exact held footprint/released commands at100%/200%; predicate mutation4red, restoration4green.\n\nRoot verification:\n\n-64 combined pending/manual/refund and documentation/routing cases across7files green14.89s; both TypeScript targets green.\n- Integrated built-client native group11/11green3.0min:3Kitchen,4View,4Bed/Yard. Actual prepared source535b3ee102, routing b390df7345, worker-uDQlX8sj.js/index-YCUrdKYO.js/index-BtHvjcB7.css. This browser client predates the later worker-only pending-removal fix, so it is not its acceptance.\n- The earlier11-file scope had66passes/1citation failure from PNG hash fragments misread as commits; full real paths restore the unchanged8case citation gate. A later root-only stale remote-reference cache was fetched; combined64 includes the unchanged citation gate passing.\n\nNo test budget, timeout, retry, assertion, tariff, player string or save-format change. No hosted deployment claim. Exact-head all-green CI, clean mergeability and serial main green remain required; merge dependency #1899 first, retarget this PR to main, then re-establish all gates.\n\nEvidence: docs/research/2026-10-02-kitchen-stove-angled/README.md; docs/research/2026-10-02-template-manual-door-removal.md; docs/research/2026-10-02-template-pending-fixture-removal.md; docs